iced, normally priced </span><span class = \"strong\">OR</span> <span class = \"italic\">reduced price, discounted price, on sale</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the table. Do you know these clothing words?"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\"> Part of Body </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\"> Men and Women </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\"> Women only </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Whole body\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" suit\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"dress\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Upper body\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"shirt<br/>T-shirt<br/>sweater\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"blouse\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Lower body\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"belt<br/>jeans<br/>pants\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"skirt\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Feet\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"shoes<br/>boots\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"high-heels\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "The advertisement says there are discounts on belts, dresses, coats and shoes."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I need a new pair of jeans that fit around the waist."}, {"type": "text", "content": "We make suggestions when deciding what to do or buy in a store. <br/>Common expressions are as follow: <span class=\"italic\"><br/>How about ...<br/>Why don't you ...<br/>I suggest ...</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "How about buying that red skirt?"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to get (something)"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to buy something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to get some new clothes. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le07ob09aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when you go shopping."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ready"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "prepared to do something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I can be ready then."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le07ob09aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "advertisement"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a text, image, audio or video to help sell a product"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This advertisement is from Hamptons."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le07ob09aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "discount"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "reduced price"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are discounts on dresses, jeans, coats and shoes. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le07ob09aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "waist"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the part of the body between the chest and the legs"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I wear a size 31 waist."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le07ob09aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "belt"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a clothing accessory you wear around the waist"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: People often wear a belt with jeans."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le07ob09aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "here we come"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "showing excitement about going to a place"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Hamptons here we come!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le07ob09aud07"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le07ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look online for sizes for different pieces of clothing (shoes, T-shirts, etc.) and countries (Examples: the United States, Colombia, France, etc.)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Complete the table. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a short dialogue (4 - 6 lines) asking for the item and size you need."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice with a partner in class."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Country\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Shoe size \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"T-shirt size\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Pants\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "co